          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "Thermogravimetric analysis (TGA) was carried out on a Perkin-Elmer 7 Series thermal analysis system with an increasing rate of $1 0 \\mathrm { \\Omega } ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } / \\mathrm { m i n } , \\mathrm { N } _ { 2 }$atmosphere at the flow rate of 40 mL/min, scanning scope ranging from 50 to $7 5 0 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$, and sample weight of 5.0–7.0 mg."
