            886.0,
            394.0
          ],
          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "The thermal stabilities of the polymers were investigated by TGA in $\\Nu _ { 2 }$. The thermal decomposition temperatures $\\mathrm { ( } T _ { \\mathrm { d } } \\mathrm { s ) }$(Table 2) at 5% weight loss of polymers I–IV are $4 3 5 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } , 4 3 8 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } , 4 0 9 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } .$, and $4 1 6 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$"
